\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  \cf0  Lord in thy sight give me your grace,
\par \pard\li270\sl200\slmult0 in presence of your Kingdom.
\par wipe all away my sinful act,
\par  for the sake of your mercies.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  Cleanse me and take my sins away
\par  and all of my iniquities
\par and forever redeem me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  O Truly, all my sinful acts
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0  I have seen them by myself.
\par  My sins are open before me
\par  In all the day and all night
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par You alone have I disobeyed,
\par  and have committed sin against .
\par  You have won me by your word.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  You are so perfect O my God
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 In righteousness you judge us
\par  I was conceived in sin and then
\par again was born in my sin.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj Through your righteous judgment you will
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 reveal my hidden wretched acts
\par as it is clear before you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  My precious God forsake me not,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 cast me not away from Thee.
\par Fill me with your Holy spirit,
\par wash my heart and cleanse my soul.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Do gracefully save me my life,
\par that I may have my hope in you,
\par that keeps me in a strong faith.\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

